{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人陳嘉桓視寵物如知己，曾為了陪伴年老愛犬，晚上12點前必定回家，她現有活潑的4歲比熊「小比」陪伴，成為醫好其社恐的良方，她又直言若將來的追求者不愛狗狗，即時減分。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;陳嘉桓（R</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:15:27.268598+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T16:01:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:08:32.369957+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T16:08:32.369957+00:00","content_hash":"bdcd496fcd86017d685d6bb87f68e1543f7460c2f2c31dba01c3306bc4e67bc3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}